    "text": "# Mermaid 图表图鉴\n\n![从 C# 文档模型到 Avalonia 界面](../docs/演示文档/图片/dotnet-avalonia-pipeline.svg)\n\n用图表说明 C# 对象、.NET 服务与 Avalonia 桌面交互，比把每个细节塞进一段话更容易阅读。本页收录当前渲染器支持的 24 类图表，每种保留一个可直接编辑的短示例。\n\n源码与文档：<https://mermaid.js.org>\n\n在源码视图查看原始 Mermaid，在即时编辑中修改代码，再切换阅读检查结果。示例中的日期、时间与数值都是教学数据，不代表产品性能。\n\n## 流程图\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n  A[ASP.NET Core 请求] --> B[验证 DTO]\n  B --> C{参数有效}\n  C -->|否| D[返回 400]\n  C -->|是| E[调用 C# 服务]\n  E --> F[返回 JSON]\n```\n\n\n## 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant V as Avalonia View\n  participant VM as ViewModel\n  participant S as DocumentStore\n  V->>VM: SaveCommand\n  VM->>S: WriteAsync(path, text)\n  S-->>VM: Task 完成\n  VM-->>V: IsModified = false\n```\n\n\n## 状态图\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> Idle\n  Idle --> Loading: 执行 OpenCommand\n  Loading --> Ready: 读取成功\n  Loading --> Error: IOException\n  Error --> Loading: 重试\n  Ready --> Idle: 关闭文档\n```\n\n\n## 用户旅程图\n\n```mermaid\njourney\n  title 第一次运行 Avalonia 项目\n  section 准备\n    安装 .NET SDK: 4: 开发者\n    创建桌面项目: 5: 开发者\n  section 运行\n    绑定 ViewModel: 4: 开发者\n    验证窗口交互: 5: 开发者, 测试者\n```\n\n\n## 甘特图\n\n```mermaid\ngantt\n  title Avalonia 功能迭代示例\n  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD\n  axisFormat %m/%d\n  tickInterval 1day\n  section 实现\n    定义 C# 模型 :done, a, 2026-10-17, 2d\n    编写 AXAML :active, b, after a, 3d\n  section 发布\n    回归测试 :c, after b, 2d\n    AOT 发布 :milestone, after c, 0d\n```\n\n\n## 时间线\n\n```mermaid\ntimeline\n  title .NET 主线演进\n  2002 : .NET Framework\n  2016 : .NET Core\n  2020 : .NET 5\n  2025 : .NET 10\n```\n\n\n## Git 分支图\n\n```mermaid\ngitGraph\n  commit id: \"建立模型\"\n  branch feature\n  checkout feature\n  commit id: \"实现命令\"\n  checkout main\n  merge feature\n  commit id: \"验证 AOT\"\n```\n\n\n## 看板\n\n```mermaid\nkanban\n  todo[待办]\n    a[增加取消令牌]\n  doing[进行中]\n    b[实现保存命令]\n  done[已完成]\n    c[建立文档模型]\n```\n\n\n## 类图\n\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n  class Document {\n    +string Path\n    +string Markdown\n  }\n  class DocumentViewModel {\n    +bool IsModified\n    +SaveAsync() Task\n  }\n  DocumentViewModel \"1\" --> \"1\" Document : 编辑\n```\n\n\n## 实体关系图\n\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n  PROJECT ||--o{ DOCUMENT : contains\n  DOCUMENT ||--o{ REVISION : tracks\n  DOCUMENT {\n    int Id PK\n    string Path\n  }\n  REVISION {\n    int Id PK\n    int DocumentId FK\n    string Markdown\n  }\n```\n\n\n## 需求图\n\n```mermaid\nrequirementDiagram\n  requirement aot_release {\n    id: 1\n    text: Publish win-x64 Native AOT\n    risk: low\n    verifymethod: test\n  }\n  element desktop_app {\n    type: application\n  }\n  desktop_app - satisfies -> aot_release\n```\n\n\n## 思维导图\n\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((Avalonia 桌面应用))\n    C#\n      模型\n      异步命令\n    AXAML\n      控件\n      绑定\n    .NET\n      类库\n      Native AOT\n```\n\n\n## 块图\n\n```mermaid\nblock-beta\n  columns 3\n  a[\"AXAML View\"] space b[\"C# ViewModel\"]\n  a --> b\n  c[\".NET 文档服务\"]:3\n```\n\n\n## C4 架构图\n\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n  title Avalonia 文档应用\n  Person(developer, \"开发者\", \"编写技术文档\")\n  System(desktop, \"桌面应用\", \"C# 与 Avalonia\")\n  System_Ext(files, \"本地文件系统\", \"Markdown 与图片\")\n  Rel(developer, desktop, \"编辑与阅读\")\n  Rel(desktop, files, \"异步读写\")\n```\n\n\n## 架构图\n\n```mermaid\narchitecture-beta\n  group app(cloud)[DotNet]\n  service api(server)[ASP NET Core] in app\n  service database(database)[Database] in app\n  api:R -- L:database\n```\n\n\n## 数据包图\n\n```mermaid\npacket-beta\n  title .NET 二进制协议示例\n  0-7: \"Version\"\n  8-15: \"Type\"\n  16-31: \"Length\"\n  32-63: \"Request ID\"\n```\n\n\n## 饼图\n\n```mermaid\npie showData\n  title 桌面项目代码构成示例\n  \"C#\" : 55\n  \"AXAML\" : 30\n  \"测试\" : 15\n```\n\n\n## 象限图\n\n```mermaid\nquadrantChart\n  title Avalonia 改进优先级\n  x-axis Low effort --> High effort\n  y-axis Low value --> High value\n  quadrant-1 Plan\n  quadrant-2 Do first\n  quadrant-3 Later\n  quadrant-4 Reconsider\n  FixClipping: [0.25, 0.8]\n  NewTheme: [0.7, 0.75]\n```\n\n\n## XY 坐标图\n\n```mermaid\nxychart-beta\n  title \"C# 测试执行时间示例\"\n  x-axis \"批次\" [\"一\", \"二\", \"三\", \"四\", \"五\"]\n  y-axis \"毫秒\" 0 --> 1000\n  bar [600, 500, 450, 400, 350]\n  line [600, 500, 450, 400, 350]\n```\n\n\n## 桑基图\n\n```mermaid\nsankey-beta\n\nDotNet,CSharp,60\nDotNet,AXAML,40\nCSharp,Application,40\nCSharp,Tests,20\nAXAML,Application,40\n```\n\n\n## 雷达图\n\n```mermaid\nradar-beta\n  title \"桌面交互评审示例\"\n  axis keyboard[\"键盘\"], clarity[\"清晰\"], layout[\"布局\"], feedback[\"反馈\"]\n  curve before[\"修改前\"]{3, 4, 3, 2}\n  curve after[\"修改后\"]{5, 4, 4, 4}\n  max 5\n```\n\n\n## 矩形树图\n\n```mermaid\ntreemap-beta\n  \"Avalonia 项目\"\n    \"应用\"\n      \"ViewModels\": 25\n      \"Views\": 20\n    \"基础设施\"\n      \"Services\": 30\n      \"Tests\": 25\n```\n\n## 韦恩图\n\n用交集说明技术职责：C# 承载逻辑，AXAML 描述视图，.NET 提供运行与类库能力。\n\n```mermaid\nvenn-beta\n  set A[\"C#\"]\n  set B[\"AXAML\"]\n  set C[\".NET\"]\n  union A, B[\"Avalonia 应用\"]\n  union A, C[\"服务与模型\"]\n```\n\n## 目录树\n\n用一个最小桌面项目检查文件层级、文件名、注释与高亮。\n\n```mermaid\ntreeView-beta\n    AvaloniaNotes/\n        Models/\n            Document.cs\n        ViewModels/\n            MainWindowViewModel.cs :::highlight ## 状态与命令\n        Views/\n            MainWindow.axaml\n        App.axaml\n        Program.cs\n        AvaloniaNotes.csproj\n```\n\n---\n\n继续阅读 [.NET 历史与版本关系](.NET%20历史与版本关系.md)，或回到 [技术文档导航](主题设计笔记.md)。\n\n\n"
